sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as Atlas
  UI->>API: GET auth/csrf
  API-->>UI: Signed token and HttpOnly cookie
  UI->>API: POST login with token and credentials
  API->>DB: Read active user and current lock
  API->>API: Compare bcrypt hash
  API->>DB: Conditional atomic lock reset
  alt Locked or credentials invalid
    API-->>UI: 401 or 423
  else Valid
    API->>DB: Rotate previous browser session
    API-->>UI: HttpOnly session cookie and user
    UI->>UI: Reset CSRF cache and navigate by role
    UI->>API: Authenticated request
    API->>DB: Verify session and current active user role
    API-->>UI: Authorized response
  end
